{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o018a","title":"戴陵谏弋猎遭曹丕减死一等","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o018a-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"戴陵谏弋猎遭曹丕减死一等","evidence":["wendi-e-o018a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0013","role":"进谏获罪","evidence":["wendi-e-o018a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"治罪","evidence":["wendi-e-o018a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"黄初元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"黄初元年"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o018a-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o018a-q","source_order":[2,186,"O018a"],"order":561},{"id":"zhuge-e-p034b","title":"曹叡使司马懿督张郃费曜戴陵郭淮拒蜀","accounts":[{"id":"zhuge-e-p034b-account","label":"《汉晋春秋》","text":"曹叡使司马懿督张郃费曜戴陵郭淮拒蜀","evidence":["zhuge-e-p034b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"部署","evidence":["zhuge-e-p034b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"督军","evidence":["zhuge-e-p034b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0183","role":"从征","evidence":["zhuge-e-p034b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0012","role":"从征","evidence":["zhuge-e-p034b-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0013","role":"从征","evidence":["zhuge-e-p034b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0100","role":"从征","evidence":["zhuge-e-p034b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"祁山再战时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhuge-e-p034b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-p034b-q","source_order":[35,304,"P034b"],"order":6809}],"persons":[{"id":"wendi-p0013","name":"戴陵","evidence":["wendi-q-o018","zhuge-q-p034"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wendi-m-o018-wendi-p0013","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wendi-q-o018"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-p034-wendi-p0013","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-p034"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wendi-e-o018a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-5ab97ed25646b33c76f3","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，长水校尉戴陵谏不宜数行弋猎〖16〗。帝大怒，陵减死罪一等〖17〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o018","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-5ab97ed25646b33c76f3","layer":"original","quote":"是岁，长水校尉戴陵谏不宜数行弋猎〖16〗。帝大怒，陵减死罪一等〖17〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-p034b-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e243fc402cbd081e76a6","layer":"pei","quote":"于是魏大司马曹真有疾，司马宣王自荆州入朝。魏明帝曰：‘西方事重，非君莫可付者。’乃使西屯长安，督张郃、费曜、戴陵、郭淮等。宣王使曜、陵留精兵四千，守上邽，余众悉出，西救祁山。郃欲分兵驻雍、郿，宣王曰：‘料前军能独当之者，将军言是也；若不能当而分为前后，此楚之三军所以为黥布擒也。’遂进。","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":303,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4ccac388dda92e215134","start":37,"end":180,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p034","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e243fc402cbd081e76a6","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《汉晋春秋》曰：“亮围祁山，招鲜卑轲比能；比能等至故北地吕城以应亮。于是魏大司马曹真有疾，司马宣王自荆州入朝。魏明帝曰：‘西方事重，非君莫可付者。’乃使西屯长安，督张郃、费曜、戴陵、郭淮等。宣王使曜、陵留精兵四千，守上邽，余众悉出，西救祁山。郃欲分兵驻雍、郿，宣王曰：‘料前军能独当之者，将军言是也；若不能当而分为前后，此楚之三军所以为黥布擒也。’遂进。亮分兵留攻，自逆宣王于上邽。郭淮、费曜等邀亮，亮破之，因大芟刈其麦；与宣王遇于上邽之东，敛兵依险，军不得交，亮引而还。宣王寻亮，至于卤城。张郃曰：‘彼远来逆我，请战不得；谓我利在不战，欲以长计制之也。且祁山知大军已在近，人情自固；可止屯于此，分为奇兵，示出其后；不宜进前而不敢逼，坐失民望也。今亮悬军食少，亦行去矣。’宣王不从，故寻亮。既至，又登山掘营，不肯战。贾栩、魏平，数请战，因曰：‘公畏蜀如虎，奈天下笑何！’宣王病之。诸将咸请战，五月辛巳，乃使张郃攻无当监何平于南围，自案中道向亮。亮使魏延、高翔、吴班赴拒，大破之，获甲首三千级，玄铠五千领，角弩三千一百张。宣王还保营。”","attribution":"《汉晋春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":303,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-4ccac388dda92e215134","start":0,"end":470,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
